ah Amir"],"y":2011,"c":"pub","j":"Games and Economic Behavior","v":"71","i":"2","p":"487-502","r":17,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.geb.2010.04.011","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.geb.2010.04.011"},{"t":"Seasoned equity offerings: What firms say, do, and how the market reacts","a":["Mark D. Walker","Keven Yost"],"y":2008,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Corporate Finance","v":"14","i":"4","p":"376-386","r":78,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcorpfin.2008.04.001","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.jcorpfin.2008.04.001"},{"t":"Corporate governance and the spinoff decision","a":["Seoungpil Ahn","Mark D. Walker"],"y":2007,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Corporate Finance","v":"13","i":"1","p":"76-93","r":78,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcorpfin.2006.03.001","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.jcorpfin.2006.03.001"},{"t":"LEAPS introductions and the value of the underlying stocks","a":["Leonard L. Lundstrum","Mark D. Walker"],"y":2006,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Financial Intermediation","v":"15","i":"4","p":"494-510","r":48,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfi.2005.09.002","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.jfi.2005.09.002"},{"t":"Minimax Play at Wimbledon","a":["Mark Walker","John Wooders"],"y":2001,"c":"pub","j":"American Economic Review","v":"91","i":"5","p":"1521-1538","r":0,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1257/aer.91.5.1521","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1257/aer.91.5.1521"}]